 "modules": [
  {
   "id": 1,
   "plugin": "Core",
   "model": "Notes",
   "data": {
    "text": "FOCUS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 8, CC 17 to 32\n   1 Focus width\n   2 Focus shift\n   3 Narrow focus to Wide focus\n   4 Distraction\n   5 Fixation\n   6 Where the eye goes first\n   7 The object we keep seeing\n   8 A view we cannot trust\n   9 What we do not see\n  10 The camera stays too long\n  11 suite: Tunnel vision\n  12 suite: Looks away at the wrong moment\n  13 suite: Narrowing in\n  14 suite: Hidden in plain sight\n  15 suite: Guide the eye\n  16 suite: Trust no one\nCV-CC 2: MIDI channel 8, CC 33 to 48\n   1 pair: When a fixation tightens, the shots get closer\n   2 pair: When a distraction pulls hard, something is missed\n   3 pair: When attention starts narrowing, it hardens into a fixation\n   4 pair: When a character's attention shrinks to one thing, they miss the warning\n   5 pair: When an object is planted, the camera comes back to it\n   6 pair: When sharp focus pulls the eye, attention narrows to one thing\n   7 pair: When too many things compete for the eye, distraction grows\n   8 pair: When the camera keeps returning to an object, questions grow\n   9 pair: When the camera stays too long, dread creeps in\n  10 pair: When the lingering shot hints at a clue, the plant is less hidden\n  11 pair: When more is kept out of sight, dread grows\n  12 pair: When we catch the false view near the end, everything flips\n  13 pair: When the view gets less trustworthy, the misdirection grows\n  14 pair: When the camera stays too long, the dread rises\n  15 pair: When the big thing stays off screen, the dread builds\n  16 pairs: Eyes on one thing\nCV-CC 3: MIDI channel 8, CC 49 to 49\n   1 pairs: Clue in plain sight"
   },
